window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>She can't run from Fate... or the dragon stalking his obsession.</b></p> <p><b>Sam</b></p> <p>The scent of jasmine drove my dragon insane, consumed my every thought. I had to find her—the woman carrying that intoxicating fragrance. When I caught her trail, instinct took over. I couldn't stop tracking her, following every move she made. Stalking my fated mate became an obsession I was powerless to resist.</p> <p><b>Lauren</b></p> <p>I knew he was watching, this hulking dragon shifter lurking in the shadows. His glowing eyes followed me wherever I went, relentless and demanding. I should've been afraid, but somewhere deep down, his obsessive stare ignited a craving in me. I found myself longing for the moment he'd finally catch me.</p> <p><i>Wintermoon Shorts is a series set in the world of Wintermoon, featuring characters from the Fated Mates series. These stories focus less on plot and more on spicy moments. For mature listeners.</i></p>"; 
